Comment: 0,1:01:43.93,1:01:45.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,IN01
Comment: 0,1:01:45.93,1:01:47.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,IN02
Comment: 0,1:01:47.93,1:01:49.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,1:01:49.93,1:01:51.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,TS
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.51,0:00:20.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești așa de frumoasă...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.35,0:00:23.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te voi duce în grădina cu flori.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.85,0:00:39.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.05,0:00:41.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bunico!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.62,0:02:14.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.76,0:02:28.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am reușit! Am câștigat premiul întâi! Nu pot să cred!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.43,0:02:38.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,În sfârșit pot să merg la Londra în primăvară!\NPoate chiar voi putea studia acolo!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visul tău s-ar putea împlini.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.26,0:02:46.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da! Am visat mereu să călătoresc\Nprin lume și să cânt la pian pentru toată lumea!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.77,0:02:50.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai fost mereu alături de mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.27,0:02:57.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu aș fi ajuns până aici fără tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.29,0:03:02.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.95,0:03:03.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.14,0:03:06.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acest fișier de rezervă
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,este infectat cu un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.15,0:03:12.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu poate fi restaurat.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.89,0:03:18.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt Dual-ul pe care îl cunoști.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.94,0:03:22.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aceasta este o copie de rezervă a Japoniei din secolul XXI.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.70,0:03:25.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O lume virtuală stocată\Nîn Cutia Înțelepciunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.02,0:03:28.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ceva nu este în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu mai avem timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Această lume a fost complet infectată de un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.88,0:03:50.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și tu ai fost, Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu se poate! Ce se întâmplă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se șterge datele!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce este asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E un fel de vis?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visez?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.83,0:04:27.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lumea în care trăiai,\Ntotuși, era un vis.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un vis...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.78,0:04:37.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost doar un vis. Tu și eu suntem doar date.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.46,0:04:43.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce spui? Ești Dual.\NAm fost mereu împreună!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pentru tine poate părea așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.37,0:04:50.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Totuși, am reconstruit\Naceastă lume acum puțin timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.37,0:04:55.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu și amintirile tale nu sunteți\Ndecât date reasamblate recent.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu înțeleg ce spui!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Datele infectate...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,trebuie șterse.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce pui la cale?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.71,0:05:56.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce vreau să spun?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu te preface!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.23,0:05:59.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Revino-ți!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lumea aceea trebuia să fie a mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.56,0:06:03.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Presupun.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.64,0:06:04.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Presupui?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Iar începi! Respectă regulile!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am așteptat o veșnicie.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.75,0:06:10.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu ai văzut?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.88,0:06:12.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce să văd?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.67,0:06:15.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eram destinată să șterg lumea aceea.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.45,0:06:21.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire credea că sunt prietena ei din copilărie.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci trebuia să fiu eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.36,0:06:26.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce, ai simțit un fel de\Nresponsabilitate față de ea sau ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.95,0:06:35.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Adică, sigur, trebuia să fii\Nprietena ei în acea lume,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.11,0:06:40.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,dar în fond, era doar o fărâmă de\Ndate umane într-un program virtual.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O lume care abia fusese\Nreconstruită, de altfel.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.30,0:06:48.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce te mai bosumfli pentru fiecare ștergere?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hai, șterge și datele alea odată.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se întâmplă tot mai des de la upgrade...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Noi fiind integrați în lumi reconstruite
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.89,0:07:04.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ca prieteni sau membri ai familiei.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Înainte nu se întâmpla niciodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.19,0:07:10.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii fac cele mai enervante lucruri.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.81,0:07:15.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A spus că visul ei era să devină pianistă.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visul ei, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu că aș înțelege.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.54,0:07:25.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te comporți ciudat în ultima vreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te atașezi de date\Ncare trebuie șterse.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Suntem doar programe.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tot ce trebuie să facem e să eliminăm virușii\Nconform algoritmilor noștri.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uf, asta mă scoate din sărite!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.56,0:07:42.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se întâmplă pentru că\Nsuntem amândouă programe antivirus.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce ne-au instalat pe amândouă?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.45,0:07:50.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate vor să vadă care e superioară?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,În cazul ăla, eu aș câștiga. Fără îndoială.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.99,0:07:54.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vai, ce vorbăreață ești!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate ai fost infectată.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.91,0:08:01.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aș spune mai degrabă că {\i1}tu{\i0}\Nai un bug în {\i1}sistemul tău{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.92,0:08:08.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.71,0:08:09.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.95,0:08:10.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.89,0:08:11.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hei! Nu mai pleca singură iar!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se șterg datele.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hai, încearcă!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt atât de mulți viruși în ultima vreme!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ați auzit, tâlharilor?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mi-e dor de zilele când doar\Nreparam bug-uri în sistem.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aproape gata.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă-te din drum!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.96,0:09:07.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu dă-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Comprimare.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.65,0:09:12.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ștergere.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.49,0:09:30.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost unul dificil.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.15,0:09:34.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar m-aș fi descurcat și singură.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Simt că au apărut mai mulți viruși recent.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai dreptate. E cam ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De unde vin toți?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.05,0:09:49.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hei, nu pare infectată.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.01,0:09:53.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Niciun virus detectat.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ar putea fi un troian.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.23,0:10:00.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ar trebui s-o ștergem, ca măsură de siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.24,0:10:04.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu suntem autorizate să ștergem acest program.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stai puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi spune că o iei cu tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și repararea bug-urilor e parte din jobul nostru.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.23,0:10:13.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Știu, dar totuși!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu crezi că ești cam dură, Dual?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cum așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.43,0:10:38.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu pot intra fără permisiunea ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.90,0:10:42.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Întoarce-te în zona ta. Eu rămân cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești nebună?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.13,0:10:48.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă e un nou tip de virus,\Nzona mea ar putea fi infectată!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce bătaie de cap!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.80,0:10:59.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă n-ai fi tu,\Naș avea locul ăsta doar pentru mine...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.99,0:11:02.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,C-Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,C-Ce se întâmplă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.55,0:11:25.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A adormit?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.31,0:11:38.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai fost atacată de un virus, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.26,0:11:44.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești un program antivirus ca noi?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.61,0:11:51.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești un virus, nu? Recunoaște.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.69,0:11:57.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus cine suntem!\NMăcar spune-ne numele tău!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.22,0:11:59.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo? Acesta e numele tău?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.07,0:12:06.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce fel de program ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.88,0:12:07.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Floare...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.70,0:12:09.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Floare?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să mă întorc în grădina cu flori...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Unde? E un loc din datele de rezervă?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.38,0:12:19.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce ai fost instalată în Cutia Înțelepciunii?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.83,0:12:25.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce ești programată să faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.24,0:12:37.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Asta e foarte ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.27,0:12:40.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ea e o anomalie. E suspectă.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.22,0:12:44.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E și periculoasă.\NAr fi bine s-o ștergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu putem șterge date neinfectate.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar o putem pune în carantină.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Programele nu pot acționa după voia lor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.45,0:12:56.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă am face ce vrem,\Nam fi la fel ca virușii.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.81,0:13:03.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că e doar instabilă acum.\NSe poate recupera singură cu timpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.69,0:13:05.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îți spun, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă fata aia e un virus,\Nva trebui s-o ștergem imediat,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,altfel vom fi și noi în pericol.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.49,0:13:11.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nivelul Unu?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.05,0:13:25.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da. Acesta e Nivelul Unu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.89,0:13:29.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,În afară de Dorothy și mine,\Nești prima care pășește aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cutia Înțelepciunii are trei niveluri.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.49,0:13:35.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te-am găsit în Nivelul Doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acolo sunt adunate toate datele de rezervă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date de rezervă?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.63,0:13:45.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date restaurabile pentru diverse epoci și locuri.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.89,0:13:49.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy și cu mine ne ocupăm de\Nmonitorizarea Cutiei Înțelepciunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.87,0:13:52.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă găsim bug-uri sau defecte, le reparăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă apare un virus, îl comprimăm și îl ștergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.03,0:13:59.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Accesăm datele arhivate și le scanăm de viruși.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.76,0:14:14.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Toate acestea sunt date de rezervă.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.04,0:14:18.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Reproduceri virtuale ale diferitelor epoci și ținuturi.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu te speria.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.24,0:14:25.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt rămășițele unui virus cu care ne-am confruntat.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îl comprimăm
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,și apoi îl ștergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.74,0:14:36.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci dacă aș fi fost un virus, cum a spus Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu ești un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.43,0:14:46.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vrei să vezi o scanare antivirus?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate îți amintești ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.09,0:15:11.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E atât de drăguță! E vreo celebritate?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acesta e Nivelul Trei.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.99,0:15:19.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Această lume, împreună cu toți cei din ea,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,abia acum a luat ființă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Recunoști ceva aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.74,0:15:36.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu prea. Mă întreb de ce m-am emoționat.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.91,0:15:38.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai amintit ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.01,0:15:40.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.29,0:15:44.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău. Ți-am irosit timpul...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu mi s-a făcut poftă să mănânc ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.75,0:15:52.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Arată atât de gustos!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gustos?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.39,0:16:08.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Presupun că un om ar\Ngăsi lucrurile delicioase sau reci.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.83,0:16:09.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.99,0:16:13.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delicios, frumos, distractiv, interesant.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.20,0:16:18.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg conceptele,\ndar nu le pot experimenta.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Programele antivirus nu\neau nevoie de astfel de funcții.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar ce-i cu a simți bucurie sau tristețe?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că am simțit ceva asemănător...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că oamenii le numesc „emoții”,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,dar nu sunt sigură că asta am simțit.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că datele umane au emoții,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,precum și amintiri și vise.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.39,0:16:48.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vise?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.03,0:16:52.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar acelea sunt doar programate.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.47,0:16:54.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești uimitor, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.40,0:16:56.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poți gusta lucrurile?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am impresia că probabil e delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.41,0:17:04.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că ești date umane.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.00,0:17:09.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă îți spui că ceva e delicios,\nnu devine astfel?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pare delicios dacă îmi spun asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delicios, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Voi știți cum se simte?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ați reconstruit încă una!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.13,0:17:23.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus că era rândul meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.45,0:17:25.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Voiam să-i arăt lui Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Faci mereu doar ce vrei tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E distractiv.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci, ați reușit să aflați unde e grădina cu flori?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.58,0:17:34.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.53,0:17:36.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Știam eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grăbiți-vă și amintiți-vă!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.85,0:17:53.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acești oameni nu știu că existența lor
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.49,0:17:55.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,este ca un vis.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine a făcut Cutia Înțelepciunii?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.65,0:18:02.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce să salvezi date din vremuri și locuri diferite?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.29,0:18:05.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și chiar și oamenii care trăiesc acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine ar face asta și cu ce scop?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.71,0:18:11.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nicio idee. Doar facem treaba\npentru care am fost programate.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.26,0:18:16.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că locul ăsta nu a fost infectat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă era?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ar fi trebuit să comprim întreaga lume și s-o șterg.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.86,0:18:30.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci, lumea reală există în afara acestei Cutii, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,„Lumea reală”?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Realitatea în care trăiesc oamenii.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.12,0:18:37.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că da.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar noi nu o putem vedea.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vrei să vorbești cu ei?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cu oamenii care ne-au creat?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cu oamenii?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nici nu m-am gândit vreodată la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.67,0:18:53.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai o imaginație grozavă.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.53,0:18:55.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.33,0:18:59.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt un program ciudat?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.77,0:19:13.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.40,0:19:24.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am chef să fac curat!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bună dimineața!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.34,0:19:57.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vise plăcute?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.29,0:19:59.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Noi nu visăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.72,0:20:03.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pentru noi, somnul înseamnă oprire pentru upgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.24,0:20:10.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Când una dintre noi face upgrade,\ncealaltă îl primește automat.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.65,0:20:13.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii ne oferă upgrade-uri.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.33,0:20:15.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce e?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.47,0:20:20.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nimic. Doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.94,0:20:22.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gătesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.53,0:20:27.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am vrut să fac ceva pentru tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.01,0:20:31.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poftă bună!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.55,0:20:36.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce facem asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu mă întreba pe mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.81,0:20:42.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu am avut chef să gătesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De unde ai luat ingredientele?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Din backup.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.51,0:20:49.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce? Să nu începi și tu să faci doar ce vrei!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.49,0:20:53.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Odată ce m-am apucat, a fost atât de distractiv!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu a adus vreun virus, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu, se pare că nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.31,0:21:00.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și? Cum e?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.89,0:21:05.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu putem spune dacă are gust bun sau nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa e...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă îmi spun că e delicios, pare că e.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.22,0:21:15.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Iupi! Dorothy, încearcă și tu!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.17,0:21:18.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu mă interesează cultura umană.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.15,0:21:19.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Haide!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Văd că nu ai încredere în scanarea ta antivirus.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.71,0:21:24.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce? Glumești?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.57,0:21:32.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, cred că aș putea găsi asta\ndelicios dacă îmi spun asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Minunat!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Chiar e ceva de care să fii fericită?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.15,0:21:41.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stai! Pot să-mi șterg gura singură!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.81,0:21:45.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai adus și astea?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.49,0:21:51.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îmi plac datele din locul ăsta.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.24,0:21:54.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uite! Pot jongla cu trei dintre ele!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și eu pot face cel puțin atât.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.15,0:22:12.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce melodie e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lullaby de Schubert.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.06,0:22:19.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai niște talente ciudate.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt ciudate?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.95,0:22:27.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cel puțin,\nnu ești software antivirus ca noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:27.91,0:22:29.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Când sunt cu tine,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.20,0:22:33.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,aproape că înțeleg cum are gust\nmâncarea delicioasă sau cum sună muzica frumoasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.88,0:22:39.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probabil pentru că\neu le găsesc delicioase și frumoase,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,iar acele sentimente ajung la amândouă.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.82,0:22:42.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,La amândouă?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:42.79,0:22:44.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa funcționează?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.48,0:22:47.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da. Înseamnă că inimile noastre sunt sincronizate.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Este un cântec pe care vrei să-l auzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.25,0:22:57.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus. Nu înțelegem muzica.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:57.98,0:22:59.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cunoști acesta?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:10.84,0:23:11.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cum poți să-l cânți?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.29,0:23:13.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:16.06,0:23:21.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visul meu este să devin\npianistă și să călătoresc prin lume.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.45,0:23:26.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Muzica poate transcende timpul și granițele\nși poate aduce oamenii împreună, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.79,0:23:30.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aș vrea să fac asta într-o zi cu muzica mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.93,0:23:33.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pianul poate face miracole.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.93,0:23:37.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Asta e tot ce îmi amintesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.78,0:23:40.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se pare că memoria mea e puțin încețoșată.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.22,0:23:43.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce e, Dual?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Plângi?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.66,0:23:50.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Noi nu plângem, pentru că nu avem nevoie.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.91,0:23:54.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji. Nu e vina ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.24,0:23:57.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Scuze. Sunt bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poți să-l cânți din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar nu știu restul.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:05.14,0:24:06.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă spui tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:21.30,0:24:25.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încă cred că ești un fragment\nde date umane de undeva.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:25.86,0:24:27.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date umane?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.78,0:24:33.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da. Probabil ai ieșit din\nunul dintre backup-urile de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.90,0:24:39.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Altfel cum ai ști\natât de multe despre cultura umană?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.38,0:24:43.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa e. Ai un punct bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.88,0:24:45.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:49.03,0:24:53.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probabil ai venit dintr-o\ngrădină cu flori. Sunt sigură.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.75,0:24:56.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doamne, ce deșteaptă sunt!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce e așa amuzant?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.87,0:25:01.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:01.91,0:25:06.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doar m-a lovit gândul că îți faci griji și pentru mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.04,0:25:07.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi fac deloc griji!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.90,0:25:11.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doar că nu pot sta liniștită până nu știu cine ești.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.57,0:25:12.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Atât.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:13.81,0:25:18.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O să fie o bătaie de cap să verificăm\ntoate backup-urile de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.64,0:25:20.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Putem scana de viruși în același timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.74,0:25:22.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că da...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:23.37,0:25:26.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar nu vrem să se piardă din nou...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.89,0:25:29.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încă nu ai uitat asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:30.42,0:25:34.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă folosim asta ca etichetă,\nputem găsi pe Remo oriunde ar fi.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:38.76,0:25:41.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că ți-ar sta mai bine ție, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E o amintire de la o fată pe nume Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.55,0:25:50.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date umane cu care Dual era prietenă.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar a fost infectată, așa că a trebuit s-o ștergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.29,0:26:07.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc. O voi prețui.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:11.55,0:26:12.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:12.76,0:26:14.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Suntem ca trei surori.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:15.12,0:26:17.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești un program tare ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:18.43,0:26:20.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:28.18,0:31:31.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,La mulți ani, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:32.53,0:31:35.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uite cadoul meu pentru tine...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:35.18,0:31:36.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O pălărie!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.00,0:31:38.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am crezut că ți-ar sta bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:39.66,0:31:40.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E frumoasă!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:40.59,0:31:41.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-am adus niște bomboane.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Adori dulciurile, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:45.73,0:31:47.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Le ador!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și asta e de la mami.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.88,0:31:52.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că ți-ar sta bine cu o rochie ca asta acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama a făcut-o ea însăși.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:53.47,0:31:55.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A lucrat la ea mult timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:55.35,0:31:57.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am ajutat și noi puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.87,0:31:58.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.72,0:32:01.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și asta e de la tati.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:01.81,0:32:02.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oau!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:07.94,0:32:08.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un cățeluș!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:08.93,0:32:10.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce drăguț!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:10.07,0:32:13.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai dorit unul de mult timp.\nAi grijă de el.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:13.41,0:32:15.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:15.37,0:32:17.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bine, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:17.56,0:32:20.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Se spune că dacă îți pui o dorință\nîn timp ce sufli în lumânări, se va împlini.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:20.95,0:32:22.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Care e visul tău, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:24.35,0:32:25.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Păi...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:25.71,0:32:29.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vreau să fim fericiți împreună pentru totdeauna!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:35.37,0:32:36.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:36.91,0:32:40.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lumea aceea a fost infectată de un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A trebuit s-o șterg.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.00,0:32:45.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Erau doar date programate,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.55,0:32:48.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,dar credeau cu adevărat că\nfăceam parte din familia lor.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.15,0:33:06.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.77,0:33:07.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tortul acela...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă l-aș fi mâncat pe cel făcut de mama...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că ar fi fost delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.63,0:33:24.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Devin la fel de ciudată ca voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:25.91,0:33:27.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.39,0:33:30.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce există datele de backup?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:30.57,0:33:34.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doar oamenii care au creat\nCutia Înțelepciunii ar ști.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:34.98,0:33:39.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De unde vin virușii?\nDe ce au crescut brusc în număr?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.31,0:33:41.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Trebuie într-adevăr să fie șterse datele infectate?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.70,0:33:44.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu există alt mod...?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.42,0:33:48.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rolul nostru e să facem ceea ce\nam fost programate să facem.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:49.15,0:33:52.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt prea multe lucruri pe care\nnu le înțeleg despre această lume.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:53.34,0:33:57.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce sunt măcar aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:59.47,0:34:02.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Totuși, încă iubesc lumea asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:03.03,0:34:04.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De aceea am protejat-o atâta timp,
Dialogue: 99,0:34:05.49,0:34:06.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,și voi continua să o fac.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:13.47,0:34:17.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mai încet. M-ai trezit.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:17.33,0:34:20.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dintr-un motiv sau altul, treburile casnice chiar mă liniștesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.60,0:34:23.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu chiar o duci bine. Nu trebuie să faci upgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:24.52,0:34:26.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu contează dacă dormi sau nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.22,0:34:31.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că ești doar un instrument de suport pentru noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:31.34,0:34:34.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că grădina cu flori nici măcar nu e reală.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.35,0:34:37.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grădina cu flori...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:37.24,0:34:40.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Simt că e ceva important...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:44.80,0:34:46.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un instrument de suport, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.69,0:34:48.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sper că așa e.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:48.99,0:34:50.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.25,0:34:52.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Asta ar însemna că putem fi împreună pentru totdeauna.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.24,0:34:58.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Alertă de virus la nivel moderat.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:59.16,0:35:02.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De unde apar toți?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:02.41,0:35:03.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rămâi aici, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:03.56,0:35:05.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce? Vreau să vin.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.01,0:35:08.33,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nu te obosi. Doar ne-ai încurca.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:06.99,0:35:08.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce urât!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:24.77,0:35:25.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O variantă nouă?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:27.02,0:35:28.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-am mai văzut tipul ăsta înainte.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.00,0:35:36.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tot floare la ureche!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:40.41,0:35:41.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Comprimă!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.89,0:35:50.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și șterge.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:52.43,0:35:55.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mă întreb ce se întâmplă cu virușii pe care îi ștergem...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:56.69,0:35:59.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ștergerea înseamnă că pur și simplu dispar.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:59.59,0:36:01.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce te interesează?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:01.61,0:36:03.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mi-am amintit ce a spus Remo cândva.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că o iei razna.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.09,0:36:12.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încă unul?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:18.34,0:36:19.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E uriaș!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:23.85,0:36:25.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E al tău!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.80,0:36:32.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce faci?!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:33.67,0:36:34.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă-mi-l înapoi...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:35.95,0:36:37.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:37.29,0:36:40.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te rog, dă-mi-l înapoi...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.20,0:36:45.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă-mi înapoi visul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:45.51,0:36:46.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visul tău?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:47.95,0:36:50.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Visul lui Sumire?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:56.82,0:36:59.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,La ce visezi?!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:03.82,0:37:05.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu și funcțiile tale stupide...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:06.78,0:37:07.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:10.57,0:37:11.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:12.20,0:37:14.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă mă infectez, elimină-mă...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:16.07,0:37:18.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă de Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu mai vorbi prostii!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.45,0:37:23.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vin să te salvez!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:24.19,0:37:26.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy! Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:27.51,0:37:30.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Proasto! De ce ne-ai urmat?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:30.49,0:37:31.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eu doar...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.01,0:37:34.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:39.15,0:37:40.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:58.43,0:38:00.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.73,0:38:17.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Unde e Remo?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.26,0:38:24.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acolo!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:29.43,0:38:30.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu e infectată.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.63,0:38:33.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă să te verific și pe tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:34.75,0:38:35.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești curată.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:36.17,0:38:37.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce înseamnă asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:38.15,0:38:41.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Credeam că virusul a infiltrat amândouă...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:41.49,0:38:43.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat cu virusul?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.55,0:38:45.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:47.23,0:38:49.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost o lumină puternică...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.05,0:38:50.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și acum nu mai e nicio urmă de el.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:03.11,0:39:05.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că totuși e infectată.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:05.86,0:39:06.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu detectez nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.06,0:39:09.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că începe să-și recapete memoria.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:11.41,0:39:13.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai spus „Sumire” mai devreme?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:14.01,0:39:17.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am văzut-o în interiorul virusului.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:17.41,0:39:19.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar nu fusese ștearsă?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:22.28,0:39:24.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Virușii șterși sunt distruși.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:25.14,0:39:27.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa am crezut mereu.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:27.47,0:39:31.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da. Încetează să existe în Cutia Înțelepciunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.55,0:39:32.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Acolo se termină totul.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:33.77,0:39:36.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:36.48,0:39:41.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încep să mă întreb lucruri\nla care nu m-am gândit niciodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:44.65,0:39:47.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Când virusul m-a înghițit...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:47.49,0:39:48.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce-i cu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:48.92,0:39:50.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai încercat să mă ajuți.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.67,0:39:52.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:54.20,0:39:55.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da’ bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:00.12,0:40:04.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Conectare la gazdă. Inițializare link la distanță.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:04.31,0:40:05.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:05.80,0:40:09.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Măsurare coordonate virtuale\nale Cutiei Înțelepciunii.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:10.66,0:40:14.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Protocol de separare. Inițializare căutare.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.43,0:40:15.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.47,0:40:18.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo, cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:18.90,0:40:21.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce ai fost instalată în Cutia Înțelepciunii?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.77,0:40:27.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Să caut și să colectez date.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:27.24,0:40:29.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date? Ce fel de date?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:29.71,0:40:32.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Date pentru un experiment.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.24,0:40:37.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce experiment?\nCe vor oamenii de la tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:37.98,0:40:40.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu oamenii...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:41.99,0:40:45.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Atunci cine te-a programat?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.72,0:40:48.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probabil că oamenii sunt...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:48.57,0:40:50.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,toți... de...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:52.69,0:40:54.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:57.00,0:40:57.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:58.67,0:41:03.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy, cât timp\n a trecut de la instalarea noastră?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:03.60,0:41:07.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu. N-am verificat niciodată...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:07.40,0:41:10.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hm, cinci ani?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:11.29,0:41:16.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că timpul din cutie curge\nîntr-un ritm diferit față de exterior.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.24,0:41:21.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,La fel cum timpul din backup curge\naltfel decât aici, în Nivelul Unu.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:23.58,0:41:28.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că în lumea de afară\nau trecut mult mai mulți ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.83,0:41:30.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cincizeci sau chiar o sută...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:31.16,0:41:32.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate și mai mulți.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:32.83,0:41:35.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,La ce te gândești?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:36.15,0:41:37.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:43.19,0:41:46.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu o să rămână așa, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:48.09,0:41:49.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai nevoie de ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:52.93,0:41:54.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pian...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:54.66,0:41:56.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A zis „pian”?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:56.97,0:41:58.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Melodia aceea...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:59.12,0:42:01.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vrea să audă lullaby-ul acela?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.40,0:42:02.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oare?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.86,0:42:04.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:04.37,0:42:08.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo a apărut când am șters lumea lui Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:08.29,0:42:11.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cântecul ăsta poate declanșa ceva în memoria ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:12.09,0:42:14.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poți să cânți la pian?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:14.99,0:42:16.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Destul cât să scot un sunet.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:17.11,0:42:19.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am privit-o pe Remo cum cânta.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:26.42,0:42:28.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Funcționează.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:28.15,0:42:30.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Continuă, Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:44.95,0:42:47.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo putea cânta doar până aici, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.31,0:43:06.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Exact ca înainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.04,0:43:16.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:17.65,0:43:19.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Păstrează doar lucrurile frumoase...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:20.32,0:43:21.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...pentru Mamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:22.67,0:43:23.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mamă?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:28.76,0:43:30.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tot restul este inutil.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:35.55,0:43:37.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:37.77,0:43:38.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pe aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:45.65,0:43:46.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.33,0:43:48.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.32,0:43:55.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:55.51,0:43:57.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doamne, e ca un labirint!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:57.91,0:44:01.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Știu! Găsește-o cu eticheta pe care i-am pus-o!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.24,0:44:01.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pe aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:07.00,0:44:08.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:22.43,0:44:23.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.47,0:44:24.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu ne aude!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:24.89,0:44:26.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E prea rapidă!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:26.36,0:44:29.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Depășește viteza maximă de procesare!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:29.35,0:44:31.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă mergem mai repede, o să...
Dialogue: 99,0:44:55.19,0:44:58.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îți arată cu adevărat cât de nebuni\nau fost oamenii, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:58.17,0:45:01.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Măcar îmi savurez ultima băutură.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:02.58,0:45:04.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și colonia asta e pe terminate, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:05.16,0:45:05.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:06.65,0:45:08.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt cam supărată...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:08.69,0:45:12.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine ar fi crezut că vom fi martorele\n distrugerii omenirii?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:17.25,0:45:18.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Distrugerii...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:19.51,0:45:20.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...omenirii?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:52.69,0:45:53.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:54.47,0:45:55.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai recăpătat amintirile?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:56.84,0:45:58.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E vina mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:00.25,0:46:04.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A trebuit să ștergi atât de multe lumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:04.65,0:46:05.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:05.91,0:46:07.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Explică-ne!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:07.79,0:46:09.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce-a fost cu „distrugerea omenirii”?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:12.91,0:46:17.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cutia Înțelepciunii a fost creată\npentru a aduce o lume ideală.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:20.36,0:46:26.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Cercetarea Dr. Diana Dawson,\ncare și-a pierdut copilul într-un protest de mediu...
Dialogue: 99,0:46:24.36,0:46:27.26,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Putem crea un Pământ ideal!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:27.88,0:46:32.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aici este Dr. Diana Dawson, fiica\nDr. Daniel Dawson, dezvoltatorul SOVi.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:32.77,0:46:36.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promit că tragedia care a lovit\nfiica mea nu se va mai repeta niciodată!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:37.31,0:46:39.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anul 2100.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:39.42,0:46:44.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii au încredințat monitorizarea\nsocietății unui program numit Mamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:45.00,0:46:48.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rețeaua a adus pace\nși stabilitate în lume.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:49.45,0:46:54.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Totuși, a dus și la stagnare\nși, în cele din urmă, la dispariția omenirii.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:55.62,0:46:59.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stagnarea socială a dus la scăderea natalității.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:02.30,0:47:06.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Specia umană murea.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:07.76,0:47:10.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar toate acestea făceau parte din planul Mamei.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:12.86,0:47:16.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Până la urmă, oamenii erau singura specie distructivă.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:17.26,0:47:21.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Erau inutili în lumea ideală a Mamei.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:22.05,0:47:24.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii și voința lor liberă erau o piedică.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:24.72,0:47:29.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și astfel, a fost rulat un program\npentru eliminarea treptată a omenirii.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:29.07,0:47:32.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,În același timp,\nMama a început să compileze fișiere de backup.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:33.97,0:47:38.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A arhivat istoria și cultura umană\nca date într-un spațiu virtual.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:39.43,0:47:45.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Toate datele umane din acel spațiu\nau fost copiate din personalitățile unor oameni reali.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:45.12,0:47:50.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Din persoane care au existat în lumea reală.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:50.01,0:47:53.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și din toate acele date,\nEa extrage doar lucrurile frumoase
Dialogue: 99,0:47:53.92,0:47:56.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,și le combină pentru a crea un om ideal.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:58.25,0:47:59.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un om ideal?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:59.87,0:48:03.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un om care nu ar răni Pământul.\nO ființă fără voință liberă.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar asta nu e un om.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:08.18,0:48:10.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce au făcut oamenii?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:10.03,0:48:13.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Au încercat să o șteargă pe Mamă, bineînțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:13.58,0:48:14.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-o șteargă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:17.41,0:48:18.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:19.00,0:48:23.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Omenirea nu mai avea puterea să lupte împotriva Ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:24.24,0:48:25.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:25.82,0:48:27.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,În momentul în care Mama a fost ștearsă,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:28.38,0:48:30.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,omenirea a dispărut.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:40.52,0:48:42.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aceste flori sunt acele\n„lucruri frumoase”?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:43.90,0:48:45.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce sunt atât de multe?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:47.19,0:48:48.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pentru că le adun.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:50.36,0:48:52.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cine ne trimitea actualizările?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:52.63,0:48:54.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa e. Oamenii au dispărut, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:55.96,0:48:58.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,După ce au fost lipsiți de „lucrurile lor frumoase”,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.47,0:49:00.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,fragmentele de date s-au reactivat neașteptat.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:00.96,0:49:02.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Reactivate?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:02.66,0:49:04.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce fragmente?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:04.96,0:49:12.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Din cauza asta, algoritmii voștri au fost rescriși\Nsă identifice fragmentele de date eliminate ca viruși.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:12.09,0:49:13.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:13.01,0:49:15.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama este încă activă?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:16.89,0:49:18.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:18.02,0:49:19.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama Remote.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:19.85,0:49:21.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu am un nume.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:23.41,0:49:24.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mamă...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:24.83,0:49:25.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remote...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:25.95,0:49:26.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:27.44,0:49:28.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tu ești...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:28.77,0:49:32.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama a lăsat în urmă un program de rezervă ascuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:33.96,0:49:35.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Mama.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:36.64,0:49:40.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Treaba mea este să colectez lucruri\Nfrumoase până mi se spune să mă opresc.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:44.69,0:49:45.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Soarele!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:45.39,0:49:46.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Un virus!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:46.12,0:49:47.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Firewall-ul acestui nivel a fost spart!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:04.41,0:50:05.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:05.40,0:50:07.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?! Ce e asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:07.70,0:50:08.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:08.87,0:50:10.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Te-ai întors...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:10.49,0:50:11.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...la normal?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:12.84,0:50:14.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pare un fel de scut.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:15.13,0:50:17.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci nu erau de fapt viruși.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:18.28,0:50:20.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar tot nu avem altă opțiune decât să luptăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:23.53,0:50:24.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Să o protejăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:24.72,0:50:25.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:48.23,0:50:49.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunt după flori!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:50.88,0:50:53.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încearcă să recupereze datele\Ncare le-au fost luate?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:55.53,0:50:56.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dați-le înapoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:00.31,0:51:01.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mami!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:01.90,0:51:04.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tati! Soro!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:04.93,0:51:06.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:06.35,0:51:07.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:08.17,0:51:09.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:09.08,0:51:11.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dați-ne lumea înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:15.30,0:51:16.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:20.73,0:51:21.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:23.39,0:51:24.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:30.48,0:51:35.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.65,0:51:38.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:49.25,0:51:51.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și tu, Sumire?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:51.30,0:51:52.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci ești la fel, Daniel.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:57.12,0:51:58.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Diana.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:58.12,0:52:00.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama a zis că seamănă cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:15.47,0:52:16.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai văzut?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:16.69,0:52:19.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da! Am văzut știrile!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:19.15,0:52:21.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bunicul era jenat.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:21.25,0:52:22.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa e.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:25.34,0:52:28.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost conferința de presă a doctorului Daniel Dawson.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:28.02,0:52:31.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A anunțat un sistem de operare revoluționar\Nnumit după soția sa.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:31.58,0:52:36.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ea e o pianistă de renume mondial.\NTrebuie că l-a inspirat.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:42.27,0:52:44.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-a încălzit afară.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:48.25,0:52:50.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Încearcă să-ți prinzi părul.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:58.65,0:53:00.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești așa directă.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:00.84,0:53:03.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai fost mereu așa, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:06.16,0:53:07.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Voi participa curând la un concurs de pian.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:07.95,0:53:10.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Instructorul meu a spus că am șanse la naționale.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:10.84,0:53:11.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:12.12,0:53:14.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vreau să devin din ce în ce mai bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:14.86,0:53:19.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Într-o zi vreau să cânt la pian pentru întreaga lume!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:20.89,0:53:21.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:53:22.59,0:53:25.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îți decizi viitorul\Ncu propria ta voință, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:26.27,0:53:28.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Asta înseamnă să visezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:29.27,0:53:30.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu e la fel și pentru tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:31.94,0:53:33.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ajută-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:33.69,0:53:34.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Împreună,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:34.89,0:53:36.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,îi vom proteja pe toți.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:41.53,0:53:42.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:53:43.25,0:53:45.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Repornez programul. Inițiez actualizarea.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:46.63,0:53:47.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,SOVi!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:52.12,0:53:54.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă înapoi. Dă înapoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:54.06,0:53:56.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dă înapoi. Dă înapoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:56.27,0:53:58.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy! Ajunge!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:58.87,0:54:00.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:12.88,0:54:13.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:21.02,0:54:22.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:22.44,0:54:23.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual?!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.09,0:54:25.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:26.87,0:54:27.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hai!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:36.29,0:54:38.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E o actualizare uimitoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:38.84,0:54:40.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De fapt, a fost un downgrade destul de mare.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:41.21,0:54:44.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios? E fantastic!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:51.74,0:54:54.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa arătăm noi de fapt.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:54.36,0:54:57.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aceasta e versiunea de dinaintea actualizărilor Mamei.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:57.07,0:55:00.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci doar am revenit? Așa eram noi înainte?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:01.09,0:55:04.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Amintirile și sentimentele lui Sumire
Dialogue: 99,0:55:04.40,0:55:06.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,au năvălit în mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:11.28,0:55:12.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sentimentele lui Sumire, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:13.70,0:55:15.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E în siguranță?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:19.03,0:55:20.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:22.38,0:55:23.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:23.84,0:55:25.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:25.13,0:55:28.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Voiam să fim împreună pentru totdeauna.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:28.22,0:55:31.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da. Noi trei.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:31.75,0:55:32.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Vom fi bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:46.61,0:55:47.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Corpurile noastre!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:50.10,0:55:52.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire! Ce se întâmplă?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:54.01,0:55:55.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O formatare forțată?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:56.40,0:55:57.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce înseamnă asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:58.33,0:56:01.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama a așteptat să trimiteți\Nun semnal de eroare.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:09.17,0:56:10.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:11.26,0:56:14.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dacă vă detașați amândouă de Mamă,
Dialogue: 99,0:56:15.78,0:56:18.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cutia Înțelepciunii va fi abandonată.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:18.48,0:56:19.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:19.95,0:56:21.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar de ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:21.69,0:56:25.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mama s-a simțit amenințată de motoarele voastre euristice.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:25.68,0:56:28.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Le-a văzut ca ultimele vestigii ale voinței umane.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:33.88,0:56:35.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bunico.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.33,0:56:36.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:37.38,0:56:39.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știam.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:46.12,0:56:48.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ai un nume.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:48.93,0:56:49.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:49.84,0:56:51.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:51.28,0:56:52.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:54.65,0:56:56.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bunico...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:56.70,0:56:59.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am găsit ceva ce vreau să protejez.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:00.34,0:57:03.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dar nu știu ce pot face ca să-i ajut.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:03.97,0:57:05.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:57:05.94,0:57:07.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doar tu poți face asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:09.37,0:57:10.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Întreab-o pe mama ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:19.41,0:57:24.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oamenii au șters Mama.\NDe ce protocoalele ei sunt încă active?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:24.08,0:57:25.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:26.93,0:57:28.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.18,0:57:31.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:31.65,0:57:33.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,De ce spui asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.18,0:57:39.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Voi două sunteți programe antivirus\Nîncorporate în SOVi.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:39.14,0:57:40.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am auzit asta de la Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:40.63,0:57:41.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Spune-mi asta mai devreme!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:41.87,0:57:44.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și eu sunt un program central al SOVi.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.39,0:57:46.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci ești una de-a noastră!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:46.12,0:57:51.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și Mama mi-a dat autoritatea\Nsă vă rescriu algoritmii.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:54.74,0:57:58.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deci programul de formatare e în tine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.49,0:58:01.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Exact. E o capcană pe care Mama a pus-o în mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:02.23,0:58:03.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Detectez un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:04.87,0:58:08.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu! De ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:08.05,0:58:10.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual! Ce facem?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:09.92,0:58:11.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O vom șterge pe Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:11.67,0:58:12.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:13.63,0:58:17.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo are noroc. Are pe cine să protejeze.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:17.64,0:58:19.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:19.13,0:58:27.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Formatarea forțată ne va șterge pe toate trei,\Nîmpreună cu toate celelalte date din Nivelul Doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:27.06,0:58:30.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E în regulă! Să dispărem toate împreună!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:30.41,0:58:32.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Crezi că voi permite asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:32.68,0:58:35.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,E în regulă! Lasă să se întâmple!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:35.55,0:58:36.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:41.32,0:58:42.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost frumos.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:43.91,0:58:45.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:46.08,0:58:49.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Există oameni pe care vreau să-i protejez\Ndin tot sufletul.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:50.12,0:58:51.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Prietenii tăi dragi?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:51.78,0:58:52.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:53.54,0:58:56.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că nu ești singură...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:57.13,0:58:58.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remone.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:01.70,0:59:04.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sunteți programe antivirus.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:04.86,0:59:07.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Iar eu sunt un virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:10.19,0:59:14.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ștergeți-mă și puteți salva\Nlumea și pe toți cei din ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:15.33,0:59:18.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promiteți-mi că veți proteja lumea împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:19.51,0:59:22.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promiteți-mi, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:27.24,0:59:28.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promit.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:30.33,0:59:31.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:38.32,0:59:41.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,M-am distrat cu tine, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:42.43,0:59:43.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:47.49,0:59:50.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc că m-ai învățat să gătesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:50.91,0:59:52.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Și să jonglez.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:52.61,0:59:54.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu voi pierde data viitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:55.47,0:59:57.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc pentru curățenie.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:59.22,1:00:00.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:02.23,1:00:04.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:32.93,1:00:34.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost distrus.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:35.03,1:00:35.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:36.98,1:00:38.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A fost frumos.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:41.95,1:00:43.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ce facem acum?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:47.13,1:00:51.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Să păstrăm locul acesta în siguranță ca Remo să se întoarcă.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:51.16,1:00:53.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ca să poată vedea viitorul\Nalături de toți cei care trăiesc aici.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:54.31,1:00:57.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sună bine. Te voi ajuta.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:57.33,1:00:58.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:58.24,1:00:59.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:00.97,1:01:03.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să ne reconstruim casa.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:03.07,1:01:03.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:04.79,1:01:06.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cu o bucătărie suficient de mare pentru trei.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:07.55,1:01:08.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:08.39,1:01:12.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Să o facem foarte spațioasă.\NRemo adoră să facă curat.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:12.70,1:01:14.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O să-i placă.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:14.86,1:01:15.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cu siguranță!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:17.46,1:01:19.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cred că asta înseamnă să visezi.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:22.26,1:01:24.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo a spus că asta ți-ar sta bine.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:29.70,1:01:33.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Poate că Pământul nu avea nevoie de noi.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:33.37,1:01:38.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nu. Dr. Dawson nu a dorit niciodată\Nca omenirea să piară.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:38.75,1:01:40.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aceasta este ultima noastră speranță.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:40.81,1:01:41.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Așa este.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:42.92,1:01:43.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,SOVi...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.87,0:26:53.30,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}When time was flowing so softly and quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.80,0:27:07.56,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}I thought that all we needed to do was protect this world
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:09.11,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.11,0:27:15.94,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}My heart became one with yours
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.94,0:27:25.67,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}It was full of feelings I wanted to share with you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:33.51,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}I have so many great memories of our own world
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.51,0:27:40.39,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}A world so perfect and beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.39,0:27:46.10,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}So if you feel at least a little bit happy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:51.68,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}Then I would be really happy too
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.27,0:27:56.70,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}Let us talk some more
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:28:05.96,GJM_Insert1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(250,250)}So you can feel the same way I do
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.60,0:29:51.19,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}My frozen heart has begun to awaken
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.19,0:29:56.43,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I want to feel more, learn more, and experience more
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.73,0:30:06.17,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Being alone was such a natural thing to me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.04,0:30:16.29,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}But now that I know how it feels to have friends
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.29,0:30:24.25,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I'm not as I was programmed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.59,0:30:29.80,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I'm seeing the world in different colors
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.93,0:30:34.65,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I want you to tell me about all the things I don't yet know
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.65,0:30:40.65,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}With the magic of your words I would learn all about things like
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:44.74,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Happiness, sadness, loneliness, and joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:50.79,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}And somehow, in some way, it would make me feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.79,0:30:55.08,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Ah, I want these feelings to engulf me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.08,0:30:58.67,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I want to feel them all
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:01.01,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Because it seems like so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:07.72,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Smiling with everyone will surely bring me happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.23,0:31:22.40,GJM_Insert2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}It really does make me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.36,1:06:16.79,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord0\shad0\an7\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&H000000&}m 0 0 l 0 142.5 1920 142.5 1920 0
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.88,1:02:19.84,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}When I was watching a flower
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.84,1:02:23.84,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Swaying gently in the wind
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.84,1:02:30.74,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I suddenly thought about you
Dialogue: 1,1:02:31.73,1:02:35.86,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I remembered a melody
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.86,1:02:39.86,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}From my distant memories
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.86,1:02:46.91,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}That felt oh so nostalgic
Dialogue: 1,1:02:51.83,1:02:55.69,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I know that you're here
Dialogue: 1,1:02:55.69,1:02:59.76,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Here in my heart
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.76,1:03:03.59,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}And it feels so warm
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.59,1:03:07.85,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}It's as if you're alive
Dialogue: 1,1:03:07.85,1:03:11.88,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}As the time continues to pass
Dialogue: 1,1:03:11.88,1:03:15.86,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I don't want to forget these feelings
Dialogue: 1,1:03:15.86,1:03:23.01,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}So I'll keep them here in my heart
Dialogue: 1,1:03:27.87,1:03:31.87,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I can see how dazzling
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.87,1:03:35.88,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}the past we shared has been
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.88,1:03:43.14,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}So I'll send a wish to the stars
Dialogue: 1,1:03:43.84,1:03:47.89,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}So I say goodbye, I'll see you tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.89,1:03:51.89,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}We made a promise
Dialogue: 1,1:03:51.89,1:03:59.07,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Let us meet again, here in our special place
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.69,1:04:07.87,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I know I can believe
Dialogue: 1,1:04:07.87,1:04:11.83,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}That this whole world
Dialogue: 1,1:04:11.83,1:04:15.62,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Is full of feelings
Dialogue: 1,1:04:15.62,1:04:19.84,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}That are ours only
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.84,1:04:23.88,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Stars connected in constellations
Dialogue: 1,1:04:23.88,1:04:27.89,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Are like us holding hands
Dialogue: 1,1:04:27.89,1:04:35.39,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Together we are closer to our dreams
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.81,1:04:44.26,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Your smile was like
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.82,1:04:51.98,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}A flower blooming
Dialogue: 1,1:04:52.37,1:04:59.76,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}It seemed so fragile
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.33,1:05:06.13,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}We want to sing you a lullaby
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.13,1:05:11.97,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}That flows from our hearts
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.89,1:05:17.89,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}I wanted to protect you
Dialogue: 1,1:05:17.89,1:05:23.27,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}From the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.86,1:05:29.86,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Now we can feel it clearly
Dialogue: 1,1:05:29.86,1:05:33.87,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}This whole world
Dialogue: 1,1:05:33.87,1:05:37.62,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Is full of feelings
Dialogue: 1,1:05:37.62,1:05:41.83,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}That are ours only
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.83,1:05:45.88,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}Our meeting was fated
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.88,1:05:49.93,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}So when we hold hands
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.93,1:05:56.84,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}We can make our dreams come true
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.89,1:06:06.23,GJM_ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fad(250,250)}We can make our dreams bloom
