Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.51,0:00:20.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.35,0:00:23.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to the flower garden.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.85,0:00:39.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.05,0:00:41.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.62,0:02:14.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.76,0:02:28.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I did it! I won first prize! I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.43,0:02:38.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can finally go to London in the spring!\NMaybe I can even study there!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your dream might come true.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.26,0:02:46.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I've always dreamed of traveling\Nthe world and playing piano for everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.77,0:02:50.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've always been there for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.27,0:02:57.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have made it this far without you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.29,0:03:02.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.95,0:03:03.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.14,0:03:06.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This backup data
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,is infected with a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.15,0:03:12.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be restored.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.89,0:03:18.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the Dual that you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.94,0:03:22.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is a backup copy of 21st-century Japan.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.70,0:03:25.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A virtual world being stored\Nwithin the Box of Wisdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.02,0:03:28.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This world has been completely infected by a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.88,0:03:50.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And so have you, Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No way! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deleting data!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.83,0:04:27.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It isn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The world you were living in,\Nhowever, was a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A dream...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.78,0:04:37.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was all a dream. You and I are both just data.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.46,0:04:43.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? You're Dual.\NWe've always been together!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For you, it may seem that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.37,0:04:50.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,However, I reconstructed\Nthis world only a short while ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.37,0:04:55.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You and your memories are nothing\Nbut recently re-assembled data.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't get what you're saying!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Infected data...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,must be deleted.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you playing at?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.71,0:05:56.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do I mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.23,0:05:59.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get yourself together!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That world was supposed to be mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.56,0:06:03.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.64,0:06:04.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You guess?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.60,0:06:07.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There you go again! Stick to the rules!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.75,0:06:10.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.88,0:06:12.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See what?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.67,0:06:15.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was meant to delete that world.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.45,0:06:21.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire believed I was her childhood friend.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So it had to be me.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.36,0:06:26.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What, you felt some kind of\Nresponsibility toward her or something?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.95,0:06:35.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, you were supposed\Nto be her friend in that world,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.11,0:06:40.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but ultimately, she was just a scrap of\Nhuman data in a virtual world program.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A world that was only just\Nrecently reconstructed, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.30,0:06:48.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you bother sulking over every deletion?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and delete that data, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's been happening a lot since the upgrade...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.94,0:07:02.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Us getting integrated into reconstructed worlds
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.89,0:07:04.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,as a friend or a family member.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It never used to happen before.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.19,0:07:10.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans do the most annoying things.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.81,0:07:15.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She said her dream was to become a pianist.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Her dream, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not that I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.54,0:07:25.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've been acting strange lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're getting attached to data\Nthat's meant to be deleted.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're just programs.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.82,0:07:33.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is get rid of viruses\Nin accordance with our algorithms.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, this is getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.56,0:07:42.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is happening because\Nwe're both anti-virus software.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why did they install both of us?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.45,0:07:50.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're trying to see which one is superior?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'd win. Hands down.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.99,0:07:54.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My, aren't you talkative?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe you've been infected.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.91,0:08:01.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd rather say that {\i1}you{\i0}\Nhave a bug in {\i1}your{\i0} system!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.92,0:08:08.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.71,0:08:09.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.95,0:08:10.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.89,0:08:11.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't run off on your own again!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deleting data.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There are so many viruses lately!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You hear that, you creeps?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I miss the days when we were\Njust fixing bugs in the system.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Almost done.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.96,0:09:07.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You get out!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Compress.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.65,0:09:12.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delete.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.49,0:09:30.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was a tough one.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.15,0:09:34.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could have handled it myself though.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.74,0:09:37.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like there have been more viruses lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's pretty weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where are they all coming from?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.05,0:09:49.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, she doesn't seem to be infected.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.01,0:09:53.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No virus detected.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could be a Trojan.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.23,0:10:00.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We should delete her, just in case.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.24,0:10:04.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're not authorized to delete this program.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're taking her with you?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fixing bugs is part of our job, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.23,0:10:13.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know, but come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being mean, Dual?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.43,0:10:38.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't enter without your permission.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:38.90,0:10:42.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go back to your own zone. I'll stay with her.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.13,0:10:48.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If she's some new breed of virus,\Nmy zone might get infected too!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.80,0:10:59.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you weren't around,\NI'd have this place all to myself...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.99,0:11:02.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's happening?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.55,0:11:25.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She fell asleep?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:37.31,0:11:38.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were attacked by a virus, weren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.26,0:11:44.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you an anti-virus program like us?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.61,0:11:51.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're a virus, right? Just admit it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.69,0:11:57.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We told you who we are!\NThe least you can do is tell us your name!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.22,0:11:59.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo? Is that your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.07,0:12:06.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of program are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.88,0:12:07.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Flower...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.70,0:12:09.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Flower?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I have to return to the flower garden...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.48,0:12:15.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where? Is that some place in the backup data?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.38,0:12:19.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why were you installed in the Box of Wisdom?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.83,0:12:25.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you programmed to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.24,0:12:37.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is really weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.27,0:12:40.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's an anomaly. She's suspicious.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.22,0:12:44.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's also dangerous.\NIt'd be a good idea to delete her.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't delete data that isn't infected.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can quarantine her or something, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Programs can't act on their own free will.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.45,0:12:56.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we just did whatever we wanted,\Nwe'd be no different from viruses.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.81,0:13:03.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think she's just unstable right now.\NShe might recover on her own in due time.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.69,0:13:05.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.90,0:13:08.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If that girl is a virus,\Nwe'll have to delete her right away,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.60,0:13:10.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,or else we'll be in danger, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.49,0:13:11.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Level One?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.05,0:13:25.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right. This is Level One.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.89,0:13:29.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Besides Dorothy and me,\Nyou're the first to set foot in here.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The Box of Wisdom is divided into three levels.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.49,0:13:35.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We found you in Level Two.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's where all the backup data is pooled.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Backup data?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.63,0:13:45.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Restorable data for various time periods and places.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.89,0:13:49.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy and I are in charge of\Nmonitoring the Box of Wisdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.87,0:13:52.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we find any bugs or defects, we fix them.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.68,0:13:56.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If a virus appears, we compress and delete it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.03,0:13:59.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We access the archived data and scan it for viruses.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.76,0:14:14.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is all backup data.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.04,0:14:18.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Virtual reproductions of various eras and lands.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.24,0:14:25.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's the remains of a virus we dealt with.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We compress it
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and then delete it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.74,0:14:36.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So if I were a virus, like Dorothy said...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You aren't a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.43,0:14:46.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to see a virus scan?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You may remember something.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.09,0:15:11.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's so cute! Is she a celebrity?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is Level Three.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.99,0:15:19.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This world, along with everyone living in it,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,only just came into existence.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize anything here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.74,0:15:36.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not really. I wonder why I got so excited.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.91,0:15:38.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you remember something?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.01,0:15:40.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.29,0:15:44.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wasted your time...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just felt like eating something.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:50.75,0:15:52.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This looks so yummy!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yummy?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.39,0:16:08.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess a human would\Nfind things delicious or cold.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.83,0:16:09.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.99,0:16:13.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delicious, beautiful, fun, interesting.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.20,0:16:18.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I understand the concepts,\Nbut I can't experience them.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anti-virus programs have\Nno use for such functions.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.22,0:16:25.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What about feeling joy or sadness?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think I've felt something close...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess humans call them "emotions",
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure if what I felt was that.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Perhaps human data has emotions,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,as well as memories and dreams.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.39,0:16:48.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dreams?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.03,0:16:52.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But those are only programmed in.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.47,0:16:54.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.40,0:16:56.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can you taste things?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling it's probably delicious.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.41,0:17:04.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're human data.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.00,0:17:09.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But if you tell yourself something is delicious,\Ndoesn't that make it delicious?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It does seem delicious if I tell myself it is...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delicious, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You guys know what that feels like?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You went and reconstructed another one!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.13,0:17:23.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I told you it was my turn!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.45,0:17:25.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to show Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You always do as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So, did you figure out where the flower garden is?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.58,0:17:34.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.53,0:17:36.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and remember!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.85,0:17:53.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,These humans don't know that their existence
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.49,0:17:55.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,is like a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who made the Box of Wisdom?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.65,0:18:02.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why back up data of different times and places?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.29,0:18:05.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And even the humans who live there?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who would do that, and for what purpose?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.71,0:18:11.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No idea. We just do the job\Nwe were programmed to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.26,0:18:16.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad this place wasn't infected.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What if it was?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd have to compress the whole world and delete it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.86,0:18:30.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So, the real world exists outside this Box, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"The real world"?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The reality where humans live.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.12,0:18:37.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't see it, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk to them?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To the humans who created us?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To humans?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd never even thought about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.67,0:18:53.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have such an imagination.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.53,0:18:55.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.33,0:18:59.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am I a weird program?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.77,0:19:13.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.40,0:19:24.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like cleaning!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.34,0:19:57.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Pleasant dreams?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.29,0:19:59.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We don't dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.72,0:20:03.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For us, sleep means shutting down to upgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.24,0:20:10.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When one of us upgrades,\Nthe other one upgrades automatically.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.65,0:20:13.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans provide us with upgrades.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.33,0:20:15.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans do?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.47,0:20:20.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing. I just...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.94,0:20:22.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cooking!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.53,0:20:27.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make something for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.01,0:20:31.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dig in!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.55,0:20:36.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are we doing this?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.81,0:20:42.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just had an urge to cook.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you get the ingredients?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,From the backup data.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.51,0:20:49.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Don't you start doing as you please too!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.49,0:20:53.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Once I got started, it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She didn't bring back any viruses, did she?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nope, I guess not.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.31,0:21:00.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So? How is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.89,0:21:05.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't tell if it tastes good or not.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess that's true...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But if I tell myself it's delicious, it seems like it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.22,0:21:15.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! Dorothy, you try it too!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.17,0:21:18.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in human culture.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.15,0:21:19.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see you don't trust your own virus scan.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.71,0:21:24.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.57,0:21:32.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I could find this\Ndelicious if I tell myself it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that really something to be happy about?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.15,0:21:41.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it! I can wipe my own mouth!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.81,0:21:45.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're good.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You brought these, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.28,0:21:48.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.49,0:21:51.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I like the data from this place.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.24,0:21:54.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look! I can juggle three of them!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even I can do that much.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.15,0:22:12.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's that tune?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Schubert's Lullaby.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.06,0:22:19.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have some strange talents.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're strange?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.95,0:22:27.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least,\Nyou're not anti-virus software like us.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:27.91,0:22:29.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.20,0:22:33.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I almost understand how delicious\Nfood tastes or how beautiful music sounds.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.88,0:22:39.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's probably because I\Nfind them delicious and beautiful,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and those feelings reach both of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.82,0:22:42.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Both of us?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:42.79,0:22:44.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.48,0:22:47.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It means our hearts are in sync.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is there a song you want to hear?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.25,0:22:57.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I told you. We don't understand music.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:57.98,0:22:59.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know this one?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:10.84,0:23:11.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How can you play it?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.29,0:23:13.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:16.06,0:23:21.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My dream is to become\Na pianist and travel the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.45,0:23:26.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Music can transcend time and borders\Nto bring people together, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:26.79,0:23:30.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to do that with my music one day.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.93,0:23:33.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Piano can make miracles happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:35.93,0:23:37.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's all I remember.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.78,0:23:40.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like my memory's a little fuzzy.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.22,0:23:43.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Dual?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:44.52,0:23:45.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.66,0:23:50.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We never cry, because we don't need to.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.91,0:23:54.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.24,0:23:57.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can you play it again?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't know the rest.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:05.14,0:24:06.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:21.30,0:24:25.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I still think you're a fragment\Nof human data from somewhere.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:25.86,0:24:27.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Human data?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.78,0:24:33.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You must've come out of\None of the backups stored here.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.90,0:24:39.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How else would you know\Nso much about human culture?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.38,0:24:43.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You do have a point.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.88,0:24:45.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:49.03,0:24:53.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You probably came from some\Nflower garden. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:54.75,0:24:56.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so brilliant!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.87,0:25:01.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:01.91,0:25:06.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It just hit me that you're worried about me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.04,0:25:07.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.90,0:25:11.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just can't rest easy unless I know who you are.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.57,0:25:12.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:13.81,0:25:18.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a pain to check\Nevery single backup here.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.64,0:25:20.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can scan for viruses at the same time.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.74,0:25:22.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:23.37,0:25:26.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We don't want her getting lost again, though...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.89,0:25:29.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're still holding on to that?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:30.42,0:25:34.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we use this as a tag,\Nwe can find Remo wherever she is.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:38.76,0:25:41.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think it'd look better on you, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:42.40,0:25:45.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's a memento from a girl named Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.55,0:25:50.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Human data that Dual was friends with.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But she was infected, so we had to delete her.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.29,0:26:07.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:11.55,0:26:12.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:12.76,0:26:14.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're like three sisters.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:15.12,0:26:17.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're one strange program.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:18.43,0:26:20.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:28.18,0:31:31.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:32.53,0:31:35.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here's my present to you...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:35.18,0:31:36.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A hat!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.00,0:31:38.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it would look good on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:39.66,0:31:40.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:40.59,0:31:41.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I got you some candy.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You love sweets, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:45.73,0:31:47.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I love them!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And this is from Mommy.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.88,0:31:52.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think you'd look nice in a dress like this now.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom made it herself.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:53.47,0:31:55.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She'd been working on it for ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:55.35,0:31:57.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We helped a little, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.87,0:31:58.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.72,0:32:01.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And this is from Daddy.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:01.81,0:32:02.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:07.94,0:32:08.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A puppy!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:08.93,0:32:10.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:10.07,0:32:13.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've wanted one for a long time.\NTake good care of him.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:13.41,0:32:15.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:15.37,0:32:17.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:17.56,0:32:20.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They say that if you make a wish as you\Nblow out the candles, it'll come true.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:20.95,0:32:22.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's your dream, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:24.35,0:32:25.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:25.71,0:32:29.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want us to be happy together forever!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:35.37,0:32:36.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:36.91,0:32:40.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That world was infected by a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had to delete it.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.00,0:32:45.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They were just programmed data,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:45.55,0:32:48.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but they truly believed that\NI was part of their family.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.15,0:33:06.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.77,0:33:07.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That cake...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If I'd eaten the one my mom made...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it would have been delicious.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.63,0:33:24.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm getting just as weird as you guys.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:25.91,0:33:27.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.39,0:33:30.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why does backup data exist?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:30.57,0:33:34.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Only the humans who created\Nthe Box of Wisdom would know.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:34.98,0:33:39.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where do viruses come from?\NWhy did they suddenly increase in number?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.31,0:33:41.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Does infected data really have to be deleted?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.70,0:33:44.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is there no other way...?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:44.42,0:33:48.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Our role is to do what we've\Nbeen programmed to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:49.15,0:33:52.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's too much I don't\Nunderstand about this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:53.34,0:33:57.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why am I even here?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:59.47,0:34:02.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I still love this world, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:03.03,0:34:04.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I've protected it for all this time,
Dialogue: 99,0:34:05.49,0:34:06.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and I'll keep on doing so.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:13.47,0:34:17.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it down. You woke me up.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:17.33,0:34:20.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For some reason, housework really calms me down.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.60,0:34:23.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You sure have it nice. You don't have to upgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:24.52,0:34:26.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you sleep or not.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.22,0:34:31.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just a support tool for us.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:31.34,0:34:34.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe the flower garden isn't even real.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.35,0:34:37.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The flower garden...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:37.24,0:34:40.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's something important...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:44.80,0:34:46.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A support tool, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.69,0:34:48.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hope that's true.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:48.99,0:34:50.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.25,0:34:52.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That means we can be together forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.24,0:34:58.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A moderate-level virus alert.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:59.16,0:35:02.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where are they all coming from?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:02.41,0:35:03.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay here, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:03.56,0:35:05.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why? I want to come.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.01,0:35:08.33,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't bother. You'd just get in the way.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:06.99,0:35:08.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:24.77,0:35:25.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A new variant?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:27.02,0:35:28.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this type before.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.00,0:35:36.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Still a piece of cake, though!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:40.41,0:35:41.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Compress!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.89,0:35:50.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And delete.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:52.43,0:35:55.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happens to the viruses we delete...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:56.69,0:35:59.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deleting them means that they just disappear.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:59.59,0:36:01.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:01.61,0:36:03.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I remembered what Remo once said.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think you're going crazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.09,0:36:12.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:18.34,0:36:19.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:23.85,0:36:25.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's all yours!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.80,0:36:32.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:33.67,0:36:34.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:35.95,0:36:37.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:37.29,0:36:40.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please give it back...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:42.20,0:36:45.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give me back my dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:45.51,0:36:46.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:47.95,0:36:50.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire's dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:56.82,0:36:59.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you spacing out for?!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:03.82,0:37:05.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You and your stupid functions...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:06.78,0:37:07.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:10.57,0:37:11.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:12.20,0:37:14.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If I get infected, eliminate me...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:16.07,0:37:18.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.45,0:37:23.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to save you!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:24.19,0:37:26.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy! Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:27.51,0:37:30.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Why did you follow us?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:30.49,0:37:31.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.01,0:37:34.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:39.15,0:37:40.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:58.43,0:38:00.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.73,0:38:17.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Remo?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.26,0:38:24.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:29.43,0:38:30.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's not infected.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.63,0:38:33.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let me check you, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:34.75,0:38:35.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're clean.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:36.17,0:38:37.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:38.15,0:38:41.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought the virus infiltrated both of you...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:41.49,0:38:43.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to the virus?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.55,0:38:45.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:47.23,0:38:49.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There was this bright light...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.05,0:38:50.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And now there's no sign of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:03.11,0:39:05.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's infected after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:05.86,0:39:06.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't detect anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.06,0:39:09.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe her memory's coming back.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:11.41,0:39:13.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say "Sumire" earlier?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:14.01,0:39:17.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I saw her inside the virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:17.41,0:39:19.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But wasn't she deleted?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:22.28,0:39:24.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deleted viruses are destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:25.14,0:39:27.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's what we always thought.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:27.47,0:39:31.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right. They cease to exist in the Box of Wisdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:31.55,0:39:32.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the end of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:33.77,0:39:36.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But what if it's not?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:36.48,0:39:41.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder about things\NI've never even considered before.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:44.65,0:39:47.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When the virus engulfed me...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:47.49,0:39:48.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:48.92,0:39:50.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You tried to help me.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.67,0:39:52.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:54.20,0:39:55.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:00.12,0:40:04.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Connecting to the host. Initializing remote link.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:04.31,0:40:05.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:05.80,0:40:09.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Measuring virtual coordinates\Nof the Box of Wisdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:10.66,0:40:14.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Separating protocol. Initiating search.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:14.43,0:40:15.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:16.47,0:40:18.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo, who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:18.90,0:40:21.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why were you installed in the Box of Wisdom?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:22.77,0:40:27.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,To search and collect data.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:27.24,0:40:29.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Data? What data?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:29.71,0:40:32.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Data for an experiment.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:33.24,0:40:37.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What experiment?\NWhat do humans want from you?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:37.98,0:40:40.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not humans...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:41.99,0:40:45.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then who programmed you?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:45.72,0:40:48.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans are probably...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:48.57,0:40:50.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,all... de...
Dialogue: 99,0:40:52.69,0:40:54.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you understand that?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:57.00,0:40:57.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:58.67,0:41:03.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy, how much time\Nhas passed since our installation?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:03.60,0:41:07.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno. I've never checked...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:07.40,0:41:10.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, five years?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:11.29,0:41:16.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe time inside the box flows at\Na different rate than it does outside.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.24,0:41:21.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like how time in backup data flows at\Na different rate than here in Level One.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:23.58,0:41:28.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Perhaps far more time has\Npassed in the outside world.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.83,0:41:30.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fifty or maybe even a hundred years...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:31.16,0:41:32.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Perhaps even more.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:32.83,0:41:35.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:36.15,0:41:37.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:43.19,0:41:46.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's not going to stay like this, is she?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:48.09,0:41:49.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you need?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:52.93,0:41:54.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Piano...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:54.66,0:41:56.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did she just say piano?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:56.97,0:41:58.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That tune...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:59.12,0:42:01.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Does she want to hear that lullaby?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:01.40,0:42:02.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.86,0:42:04.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:04.37,0:42:08.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo appeared when I deleted Sumire's world.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:08.29,0:42:11.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That song may trigger something in her memory.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:12.09,0:42:14.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can play the piano?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:14.99,0:42:16.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Enough to make a sound.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:17.11,0:42:19.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I watched Remo play.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:26.42,0:42:28.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:28.15,0:42:30.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep going, Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:44.95,0:42:47.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo could only play to this part, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.31,0:43:06.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's just like before!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.04,0:43:16.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:17.65,0:43:19.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep only beautiful things...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:20.32,0:43:21.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...for Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:22.67,0:43:23.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:28.76,0:43:30.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Everything else is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:35.55,0:43:37.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:37.77,0:43:38.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:45.65,0:43:46.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.33,0:43:48.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.32,0:43:55.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:55.51,0:43:57.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's like a maze!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:57.91,0:44:01.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know! Find her with that tag we put on her!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.24,0:44:01.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:07.00,0:44:08.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:22.43,0:44:23.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.47,0:44:24.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She can't hear us!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:24.89,0:44:26.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's going too fast!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:26.36,0:44:29.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's exceeding the maximum processing speed!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:29.35,0:44:31.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we go any faster, we'll...
Dialogue: 99,0:44:55.19,0:44:58.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really drives home how foolish\Nmankind was, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:58.17,0:45:01.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying my last drink, at least.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:02.58,0:45:04.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This colony is on its last legs, too, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:05.16,0:45:05.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:06.65,0:45:08.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a little upset...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:08.69,0:45:12.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who knew we'd be witnessing\Nthe destruction of mankind?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:17.25,0:45:18.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Destruction...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:19.51,0:45:20.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...of mankind?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:52.69,0:45:53.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:54.47,0:45:55.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you regain your memories?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:56.84,0:45:58.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:00.25,0:46:04.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You had to delete so many worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:04.65,0:46:05.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:05.91,0:46:07.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Explain it to us!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:07.79,0:46:09.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What was that about the\N"destruction of mankind"?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:12.91,0:46:17.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The Box of Wisdom was created\Nto bring about an ideal world.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:20.36,0:46:26.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The research of Dr. Diana Dawson,\Nwho lost her child during an environmental protest...
Dialogue: 99,0:46:24.36,0:46:27.26,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We can create an ideal Earth!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:27.88,0:46:32.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here is Dr. Diana Dawson, daughter of\NDr. Daniel Dawson, the developer of ViOS.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:32.77,0:46:36.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I promise you that the tragedy that befell\Nmy daughter will never happen again!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:37.31,0:46:39.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The year 2100.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:39.42,0:46:44.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans entrusted the monitoring\Nof society to a program called Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:45.00,0:46:48.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The network brought peace\Nand stability to the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:49.45,0:46:54.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,However, it also led to the stagnation\Nand eventual demise of human civilization.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:55.62,0:46:59.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Social stagnation led to lower birth rates.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:02.30,0:47:06.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The human species was dying out.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:07.76,0:47:10.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But that was all part of Mother's plan.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:12.86,0:47:16.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,After all, humans were the only destructive species.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:17.26,0:47:21.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They were unnecessary in Mother's ideal world.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:22.05,0:47:24.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans, and their free will, were a hindrance.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:24.72,0:47:29.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And so, a program was run\Nto phase out the human race.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:29.07,0:47:32.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,At the same time,\NMother began compiling backup files.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:33.97,0:47:38.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It archived humanity's history\Nand culture as data in a virtual space.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:39.43,0:47:45.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All of the human data in that space was\Ncopied from the personalities of humans.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:45.12,0:47:50.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,From people that actually existed in the real world.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:50.01,0:47:53.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And from all that data,\Nshe is extracting only the beautiful things
Dialogue: 99,0:47:53.92,0:47:56.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and assembling them to create an ideal human.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:58.25,0:47:59.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,An ideal human?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:59.87,0:48:03.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A human that wouldn't harm the Earth.\NA creature without free will.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But that's not human.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:08.18,0:48:10.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What did the humans do?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:10.03,0:48:13.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They tried to delete Mother, of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:13.58,0:48:14.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delete?!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:17.41,0:48:18.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:48:19.00,0:48:23.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humanity no longer had the power to fight Her.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:24.24,0:48:25.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:25.82,0:48:27.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The moment Mother was deleted,
Dialogue: 99,0:48:28.38,0:48:30.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,humanity died out.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:40.52,0:48:42.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are these flowers those\Nso-called "beautiful things"?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:43.90,0:48:45.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many of them?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:47.19,0:48:48.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm gathering them.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:50.36,0:48:52.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who was sending us our upgrades?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:52.63,0:48:54.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. Humans are gone, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:55.96,0:48:58.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,After being stripped of their "beautiful things",
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.47,0:49:00.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the data remnants unexpectedly reactivated.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:00.96,0:49:02.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Reactivated?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:02.66,0:49:04.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What remnants?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:04.96,0:49:12.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because of that, your algorithms were rewritten\Nto identify remnants of stripped data as viruses.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:12.09,0:49:13.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:13.01,0:49:15.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother is still active?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:16.89,0:49:18.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:18.02,0:49:19.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother Remote.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:19.85,0:49:21.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a name.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:23.41,0:49:24.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:24.83,0:49:25.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remote...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:25.95,0:49:26.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:27.44,0:49:28.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:28.77,0:49:32.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother left behind one hidden backup program.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:33.96,0:49:35.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I am Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:36.64,0:49:40.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My job is to collect beautiful\Nthings until I'm ordered to stop.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:44.69,0:49:45.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The sun!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:45.39,0:49:46.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A virus!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:46.12,0:49:47.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This level's firewall has been breached!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:04.41,0:50:05.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:05.40,0:50:07.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What is this?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:07.70,0:50:08.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:08.87,0:50:10.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're back...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:10.49,0:50:11.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...to normal?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:12.84,0:50:14.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This seems like some sort of shield.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:15.13,0:50:17.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So they weren't actually viruses.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:18.28,0:50:20.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But we still have no other choice than to fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:23.53,0:50:24.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's protect her!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:24.72,0:50:25.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:48.23,0:50:49.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're after the flowers!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:50.88,0:50:53.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to retrieve the data\Nthat was stripped from them?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:55.53,0:50:56.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:00.31,0:51:01.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:01.90,0:51:04.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Sis!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:04.93,0:51:06.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:06.35,0:51:07.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:08.17,0:51:09.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:09.08,0:51:11.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give us our world back!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:15.30,0:51:16.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:20.73,0:51:21.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:51:23.39,0:51:24.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:30.48,0:51:35.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.65,0:51:38.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:49.25,0:51:51.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You too, Sumire?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:51.30,0:51:52.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you're the same then, Daniel.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:57.12,0:51:58.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Diana.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:58.12,0:52:00.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom said she looks like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:15.47,0:52:16.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see it?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:16.69,0:52:19.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I did! I saw the news!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:19.15,0:52:21.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa looked embarrassed.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:21.25,0:52:22.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He sure did.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:25.34,0:52:28.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was Dr. Daniel Dawson's press conference.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:28.02,0:52:31.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He announced a revolutionary\NOS named after his wife.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:31.58,0:52:36.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's a world-famous pianist.\NShe must have inspired him.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:42.27,0:52:44.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's getting warm.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:48.25,0:52:50.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Try tying up your hair.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:58.65,0:53:00.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're so brusque.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:00.84,0:53:03.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were always like that, Dual.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:06.16,0:53:07.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm entering a piano competition soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:07.95,0:53:10.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My instructor said I have a shot at nationals.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:10.84,0:53:11.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:12.12,0:53:14.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to keep improving.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:14.86,0:53:19.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,One day I want to play piano for the whole world!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:20.89,0:53:21.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:53:22.59,0:53:25.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're deciding your future\Nwith your own free will, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:26.27,0:53:28.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:29.27,0:53:30.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it the same for you?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:31.94,0:53:33.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:33.69,0:53:34.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Together,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:34.89,0:53:36.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,we'll protect everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:41.53,0:53:42.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire...
Dialogue: 99,0:53:43.25,0:53:45.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Restarting program. Initiating upgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:46.63,0:53:47.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ViOS!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:52.12,0:53:54.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back. Give it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:54.06,0:53:56.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back. Give it back.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:56.27,0:53:58.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy! That's enough!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:58.87,0:54:00.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:12.88,0:54:13.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:21.02,0:54:22.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:22.44,0:54:23.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual?!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.09,0:54:25.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:26.87,0:54:27.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:36.29,0:54:38.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is one amazing upgrade!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:38.84,0:54:40.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, it was a pretty major downgrade.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:41.21,0:54:44.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really? It's fantastic!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:51.74,0:54:54.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is how we really look.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:54.36,0:54:57.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is the version before Mother's updates.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:57.07,0:55:00.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So we just reverted? Is this how we used to be?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:01.09,0:55:04.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire's memories and feelings
Dialogue: 99,0:55:04.40,0:55:06.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,all came flooding into me.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:11.28,0:55:12.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire's feelings, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:13.70,0:55:15.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is she safe?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:19.03,0:55:20.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:22.38,0:55:23.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:23.84,0:55:25.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:25.13,0:55:28.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted us to be together forever.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:28.22,0:55:31.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. The three of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:31.75,0:55:32.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:46.61,0:55:47.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Our bodies!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:50.10,0:55:52.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire! What's happening?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:54.01,0:55:55.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A forced format?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:56.40,0:55:57.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:58.33,0:56:01.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother was waiting for you\Nto send an error signal.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:09.17,0:56:10.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:11.26,0:56:14.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If both of you detach yourselves from Mother,
Dialogue: 99,0:56:15.78,0:56:18.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the Box of Wisdom will be abandoned.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:18.48,0:56:19.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:19.95,0:56:21.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:21.69,0:56:25.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mother felt threatened by your heuristic engines.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:25.68,0:56:28.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She saw them as the last vestiges of human will.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:33.88,0:56:35.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.33,0:56:36.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:37.38,0:56:39.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:46.12,0:56:48.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have a name.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:48.93,0:56:49.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:49.84,0:56:51.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:51.28,0:56:52.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:54.65,0:56:56.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 99,0:56:56.70,0:56:59.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I found something I want to protect.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:00.34,0:57:03.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what I can do to help them.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:03.97,0:57:05.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo...
Dialogue: 99,0:57:05.94,0:57:07.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Only you can do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:09.37,0:57:10.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ask your mom.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:19.41,0:57:24.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Humans deleted Mother.\NWhy are her protocols still active?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:24.08,0:57:25.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:26.93,0:57:28.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo! Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.18,0:57:31.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:31.65,0:57:33.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying that?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.18,0:57:39.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You two are anti-virus programs\Nthat are embedded in ViOS.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:39.14,0:57:40.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that from Sumire.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:40.63,0:57:41.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me that sooner!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:41.87,0:57:44.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm also a core program of ViOS.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:44.39,0:57:46.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you're one of us!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:46.12,0:57:51.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And Mother gave me the authority\Nto rewrite your algorithms.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:54.74,0:57:58.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So the formatting program is inside you?!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.49,0:58:01.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bingo. It's a trap Mother embedded in me.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:02.23,0:58:03.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I detect a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:04.87,0:58:08.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No! Why?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:08.05,0:58:10.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual! What should we do?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:09.92,0:58:11.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll end up erasing Remo!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:11.67,0:58:12.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sumire!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:13.63,0:58:17.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo is lucky. She has something to protect.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:17.64,0:58:19.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dual...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:19.13,0:58:27.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The forced format will delete the three of us,\Nalong with all other data in Level Two.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:27.06,0:58:30.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's fine! Let's all disappear together!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:30.41,0:58:32.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You think I'll allow that to happen?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:32.68,0:58:35.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine! Let it happen!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:35.55,0:58:36.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:41.32,0:58:42.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:43.91,0:58:45.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:46.08,0:58:49.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There are people I want to protect\Nfrom the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:50.12,0:58:51.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Your precious friends?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:51.78,0:58:52.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:53.54,0:58:56.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're not alone...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:57.13,0:58:58.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remone.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:01.70,0:59:04.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're anti-virus programs.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:04.86,0:59:07.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm a virus.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:10.19,0:59:14.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delete me and you can save\Nthe world and everyone in it.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:15.33,0:59:18.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll protect the world together.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:19.51,0:59:22.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Promise me, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:27.24,0:59:28.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:30.33,0:59:31.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dorothy.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:38.32,0:59:41.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had fun with you, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:42.43,0:59:43.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:47.49,0:59:50.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for teaching me how to cook.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:50.91,0:59:52.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And how to juggle.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:52.61,0:59:54.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I won't lose next time.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:55.47,0:59:57.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for cleaning.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:59.22,1:00:00.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:02.23,1:00:04.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Remo.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:32.93,1:00:34.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:35.03,1:00:35.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:36.98,1:00:38.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:41.95,1:00:43.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:47.13,1:00:51.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep this place safe so Remo can come back.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:51.16,1:00:53.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So she can see the future\Nwith everyone living here.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:54.31,1:00:57.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. I'll help you.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:57.33,1:00:58.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:58.24,1:00:59.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:00.97,1:01:03.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We have to rebuild our house.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:03.07,1:01:03.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:04.79,1:01:06.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,With a kitchen big enough for three.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:07.55,1:01:08.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:08.39,1:01:12.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make it really spacious.\NRemo likes to clean.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:12.70,1:01:14.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She'll love it.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:14.86,1:01:15.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For sure!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:17.46,1:01:19.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess this is what it means to dream.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:22.26,1:01:24.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remo said this would look good on you.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:29.70,1:01:33.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Earth didn't need us.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:33.37,1:01:38.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No. Dr. Dawson never wished\Nfor mankind to perish.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:38.75,1:01:40.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is our last hope.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:40.81,1:01:41.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:42.92,1:01:43.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ViOS...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.20,0:46:53.20,BigAssTitle2,,0,0,0,,
